    <scopecontent encodinganalog="3.3.1">
      <p>This collection functions as a record of commencements done by Texas A&amp;M's College of Veterinary Medicine. These programs are reports to the public, who attends the commencement, and clearly list all candidates for graduation.</p>
    </scopecontent>
    <arrangement encodinganalog="3.3.4">
      <p>This collection is organized in chronologic order and housed in one box.</p>
